{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16896","headline":"桃源行送友 · 武元衡","name":"桃源行送友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武陵川径入幽遐，中有鸡犬秦人家，家傍流水多桃花。\n桃花两边种来久，流水一通何时有。\n垂条落蘂暗春风，夹岸芳菲至山口。\n岁岁年年能寂寥，林下青苔日爲厚。\n时有仙鸟来衔花，曾无世人此携手。\n可怜不知若爲名，君往从之多所更。\n古驿荒桥平路尽，崩湍怪石小溪行。\n相见维舟登览处，红堤绿岸宛然成。\n多君此去从仙隐，令人晚节悔营营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}